# Rates UI

Guests see weekday **250 €** (Pon–Čet) and weekend **450 €** (Pet–Ned). Deposit to confirm: **100 €**. Never show 15%/25% stay discounts.

## Page fare (PricingBoard / section)

One short two-cell strip — not two stacked cards. ~2 lines tall.

- Left: `Radni dani` + `Pon – Čet` / **250** € / noć
- Right: `Vikend` + `Pet – Ned` / **450** € / noć (copper number, faint warm fill)
- Classes: `.vh-fare`, `.vh-fare-cell`, `.vh-fare-cell--peak`, `.vh-fare-label`, `.vh-fare-sum`
- Keep side-by-side on phone. Do not stack.

## Booking modal fare (`RatesStrip variant="bubble"`)

Two side-by-side editorial cards (`.vh-fare-cards`) plus a deposit note. Keep side-by-side on phone. No stay-discount copy.

- Weekday: cream, serif **250** €
- Weekend: warm copper wash, serif **450** €
- Below: centered caption `Kapara · 100 € · Za potvrdu rezervacije.` No box, no invoice line.

## Do not ship

- Two tall rate cards (phone scroll)
- Forest/sunset split, sun/moon icons, script “ili” medallion, giant display numbers
- Extra muted disclaimer under the rates in `variant="bubble"`
